    <ns0:title>v0.42.1 — fix component resolution in `from_pretrained` to prevent `trust_remote_code` bypass</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This is a security release. See &lt;a href="https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers/security/advisories/GHSA-4prv-5hj7-c2xr"&gt;GHSA-4prv-5hj7-c2xr&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This patch release fixes how a component's declared library name is resolved when loading with &lt;code&gt;from_pretrained&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipelines and models declare each component as a &lt;code&gt;["&amp;lt;library&amp;gt;", "&amp;lt;class&amp;gt;"]&lt;/code&gt;</ns0:content>
    <ns0:author>
      <ns0:name>DN6</ns0:name>
    </ns0:author>
