    <ns0:title>Diffusers 0.37.0: Modular Diffusers, New image and video pipelines, multiple core library improvements, and more 🔥</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Modular Diffusers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modular Diffusers introduces a new way to build diffusion pipelines by composing reusable blocks. Instead of writing entire pipelines from scratch, you can now mix and match building blocks to create custom workflows tailored to your specific needs! This complements the existing &lt;code&gt;DiffusionPipeline&lt;/code&gt; class, providing a more flexible way to create custom diffu</ns0:content>
